<title>USA: Coastal shuts in production in U.S. Gulf.</title>
<headline>Coastal shuts in production in U.S. Gulf.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Corp shut in about 100 million cubic feet of natural gas production and 5,000 barrels of condensate from two platforms as Hurricane Danny stormed through the central U.S. Gulf, a company spokesman said.</p>
